#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:1071 src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:1072
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "FFmpeg encoders"
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:1073
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid ""
"FFmpeg encoders extend Elten's recording and media-conversion tools with addit"
"ional output formats, including MP3, AAC, FLAC, WMA, AVI, MP4, MOV and MPG. In"
"stall them if you expect to save recordings or conversions in any of these for"
"mats. The program works in the background and adds no menu items of its own."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:1077 src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:1078
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "File Manager"
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:1079
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid ""
"File Manager adds a file browser to the Programs menu, driven with the familia"
"r Elten controls. It can open and preview supported files, play audio, make re"
"cordings, rename and copy items, and create or extract ZIP archives. Install i"
"t if you would like to manage local files without leaving Elten."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:1083
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "MCP integration for advanced users"
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:1084
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "MCP"
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:1085
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid ""
"MCP lets you connect Elten with AI assistants and other automation tools. Once"
" set up, such a tool can, with your permission, use selected Elten features on"
" your behalf, bringing your community into the things you already do with an A"
"I assistant. You stay in control throughout: everything works only on this com"
"puter, the integration is disabled after installation until you enable it in P"
"rogram settings, and each connected tool must be granted its permissions expli"
"citly. Setting it up takes a little technical confidence, so treat it as a fea"
"ture for more advanced users."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:1095
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "Source code and contributions"
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:1096
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid ""
"Elten is free, open-source software released under the GNU General Public Lice"
"nse, version 3, and its complete source code and development history are publi"
"c on GitHub. Contributions are genuinely welcome: well-scoped features, bug fi"
"xes and translations are all reviewed and merged when ready. If you ever decid"
"e to contribute, thank you in advance for the time and care you put into it."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:1097
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "Open the Elten repository"
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:1104 src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:1106
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "Supporting Elten"
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:1107
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid ""
"Elten is free to use, but keeping it running is not free: servers, domains and"
" infrastructure all carry real costs, borne by the Prowadnica Foundation, whic"
"h supports the project's development. If Elten is valuable to you, there are t"
"wo easy ways to help. Premium packages add optional conveniences to your accou"
"nt, and the proceeds go towards the upkeep of the service; you will find them "
